WEBVTT

00:01.918 --> 00:03.128
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:03.211 --> 00:05.004
Kids: Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：是的，是的，队长。

00:05.088 --> 00:06.715
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.798 --> 00:08.425
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.508 --> 00:11.177
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.261 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.849
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.932 --> 00:17.642
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.726 --> 00:19.978
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:20.061 --> 00:21.771
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.855 --> 00:24.065
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:24.149 --> 00:26.192
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:26.276 --> 00:27.944
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:28.027 --> 00:29.571
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.654 --> 00:31.531
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.614 --> 00:33.700
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.783 --> 00:37.078
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:57.599 --> 01:00.477
Hey, I'm expecting
a 50-cent rebate check.
嘿嘿，我期待着
50 美分的回扣支票。

01:00.560 --> 01:01.895
Give me, give me,
give me, give me.
给我，给我，
给我，给我。

01:01.978 --> 01:03.313
Sorry, no check.
抱歉，没有检查。

01:03.396 --> 01:05.231
But I've got this.
但我有这个。

01:05.315 --> 01:06.858
Oh, correspondence
in a bottle, ay?
噢，信件
在瓶子里，是吗？

01:06.941 --> 01:09.194
"Ahoy, Eugene.
“嘿，尤金。

01:09.277 --> 01:12.113
I'm so proud you followed
your old grandpa's peg leg
and became a pirate
我很自豪你关注了
你老爷爷的假腿
并成为一名海盗

01:12.197 --> 01:14.741
that I'll be sailing by
for a ship's inspection.
我将航行经过
用于船舶检查。

01:14.824 --> 01:17.660
That vessel better be
well-oiled or you'll be dancing
the short plank jig.
那艘船最好是
加油，否则你会跳舞
短木板夹具。

01:17.744 --> 01:20.288
Happy lootin',
Grandpa Redbeard."
快乐的抢劫，
红胡子爷爷。”

01:20.371 --> 01:21.664
: Ah!
：啊！

01:24.667 --> 01:27.462
I didn't know your grandpa
was a pirate, Mr. Krabs?
我不认识你爷爷
是海盗吗，蟹老板？

01:27.545 --> 01:30.673
Aye... I come from
a whole family of pirates.
是的...我来自
整个海盗家族。

01:30.757 --> 01:32.550
Gramps used to say:
爷爷常说：

01:32.634 --> 01:34.511
"The Krabs clan
has been pirates
“蟹蟹一族
曾经是海盗

01:34.594 --> 01:36.471
for as long as
we've had claws."
只要
我们有爪子。”

01:36.554 --> 01:37.764
And he wanted me to
be a pirate, too.
他希望我
也成为一名海盗。

01:43.353 --> 01:45.271
One day you'll be
a plundering pirate
有一天你会成为
掠夺的海盗

01:45.355 --> 01:47.524
just like your
old granddad here.
就像你的一样
老爷爷在这里。

01:47.607 --> 01:49.651
Aargh.
啊啊。

01:49.734 --> 01:52.195
Krabs: So I bought me a ship,
hired a crew...
蟹老板：所以我买了一艘船，
雇了一个船员...

01:52.278 --> 01:54.239
Aargh!
啊啊！

01:54.322 --> 01:56.950
...and for years I drifted
the high seas as a pirate.
......多年来我一直在漂泊
作为海盗在公海上航行。

01:59.536 --> 02:01.037
And booty did abound.
战利品确实比比皆是。

02:03.540 --> 02:04.624
I started to notice
a recurring theme.
我开始注意到
一个反复出现的主题。

02:09.212 --> 02:10.880
Oh!
哦！

02:10.964 --> 02:12.841
...I just wasn't turning
enough profit
……我只是没有转身
足够的利润

02:12.924 --> 02:17.554
so I fired me crew,
and sold me ship.
所以我解雇了我的船员
并把船卖给了我。

02:17.637 --> 02:19.514
'Twas also the last time
I saw me granddad.
这也是最后一次
我看见了我爷爷。

02:19.597 --> 02:22.475
Aargh, if it ain't me
pirate grandson.
啊啊，如果不是我的话
海盗孙子。

02:22.559 --> 02:24.686
Well, actually Grandpa,
I just sold...
嗯，其实爷爷，
我刚卖...

02:24.769 --> 02:26.980
You know how proud
if makes me
你知道有多骄傲
如果让我

02:27.063 --> 02:29.983
to see me only
grandson continuing in
the family business.
只见我一个人
孙子继续
家族企业。

02:30.066 --> 02:31.985
:
Eh, yeah, Grandpa...
：
呃，是啊，爷爷……

02:32.068 --> 02:33.611
And I'll be keeping me
eye on your career
我会保留我
关注你的职业生涯

02:33.695 --> 02:36.197
to see how you progress.
看看你进步如何。

02:36.281 --> 02:40.660
Just remember, the only rule in
the pirate's code of honor is
请记住，唯一的规则是
海盗的荣誉准则是

02:40.743 --> 02:43.788
never  tell a lie.
永远不要说谎。

02:45.665 --> 02:47.750
For all he knows
据他所知

02:47.834 --> 02:50.003
the Krusty Krab
is a pirate ship.
蟹堡王
是一艘海盗船。

02:50.086 --> 02:52.171
If he were to find
out the truth
如果他找到
说出真相

02:52.255 --> 02:54.841
it'd break his salty,
barnacle-encrusted heart.
它会打破他的咸味，
布满藤壶的心。

02:57.093 --> 03:00.221
Why don't we just make
the Krusty Krab look
like a pirate ship.
我们为什么不直接做
蟹堡王造型
就像海盗船一样。

03:00.305 --> 03:02.515
Hm, not a bad idea, boy.
嗯，这主意不错，孩子。

03:02.599 --> 03:04.684
But we're gonna need
a first-rate crew.
但我们需要
一流的船员。

03:04.767 --> 03:07.103
We got Squidward- and I could
get Patrick to join up.
我们得到了章鱼哥——我可以
让帕特里克加入。

03:07.186 --> 03:08.605
Yeah.
是的。

03:08.688 --> 03:10.732
Krabs: All right, me hearties-
螃蟹：好吧，亲爱的——

03:10.815 --> 03:12.984
get this one thing clear.
把这一件事弄清楚。

03:13.067 --> 03:15.778
If Grandpa Redbeard is ever
gonna believe I'm a pirate
如果红胡子爷爷曾经
相信我是一名海盗

03:15.862 --> 03:18.656
ye land lubbers is gonna have
to pass for a pirate crew.
你们这些旱鸭子将会有
冒充海盗团伙。

03:21.242 --> 03:22.911
Which means...
这意味着...

03:22.994 --> 03:25.788
I want you to  look
like a pirate.
我想让你看看
像海盗一样。

03:25.872 --> 03:28.499
I want you to  talk
like a pirate.
我想让你说话
像海盗一样。

03:28.583 --> 03:30.585
Swarthy!
黝黑的！

03:30.668 --> 03:33.296
: I mean,
shiver me timbers.
：我的意思是，
让我颤抖。

03:33.379 --> 03:35.173
But most importantly
但最重要的是

03:35.256 --> 03:36.799
I want you to
我要你

03:36.883 --> 03:39.093
smell  like a pirate.
闻起来像海盗。

03:41.095 --> 03:42.388
Ohh.
哦。

03:42.472 --> 03:44.307
Very convincing, Patrick.
非常有说服力，帕特里克。

03:44.390 --> 03:46.476
And as me crew...
而作为我的船员...

03:46.559 --> 03:50.063
You'd be making the Krusty Krab
into an imitation pirate ship.
你会做蟹堡王
进入一艘仿海盗船。

03:50.146 --> 03:53.024
Now let's get this
restaurant ready to sail.
现在让我们得到这个
餐厅准备起航。

04:22.887 --> 04:24.347
Krabs: Way to go, fellers.
螃蟹：干得好，伙计们。

04:24.430 --> 04:27.016
Grandpa: Whee... Ha!
爷爷：呼……哈！

04:27.100 --> 04:28.351
He's coming.
他来了。

04:30.395 --> 04:31.729
Hold me, boy.
抱紧我，男孩。

04:31.813 --> 04:33.731
Eugene, me boy.
尤金，我的孩子。

04:33.815 --> 04:35.566
Ah, it's good to see
you and your ship
啊，很高兴看到
你和你的船

04:35.650 --> 04:37.610
after so many moons.
经过这么多个月。

04:37.694 --> 04:40.822
'Twas beginning to think you was
lying to your old granddad.
我开始以为你是
对你的老爷爷撒谎。

04:40.905 --> 04:42.824
:
Oh, I... Ehh...
：
哦，我……呃……

04:42.907 --> 04:45.284
Mm, ha  .
嗯，哈。

04:45.368 --> 04:47.453
So have you met me hearties?
那么你见过我的心吗？

04:47.537 --> 04:49.038
Hmm...
唔...

04:49.122 --> 04:51.541
...You call this a pirate crew?
……你管这叫海贼团？

04:51.624 --> 04:55.628
They more resemble jellyfishers
than swarthy brine skimmers.
它们更像水母
比黑色的盐水撇油器。

04:55.712 --> 04:57.463
Um...
嗯...

04:57.547 --> 04:59.882
I'm just yanking
your chain, boy.
我只是拉扯
你的链子，孩子。

04:59.966 --> 05:02.677
You look like a fine
pirate crew.
你看起来像个好人
海盗船员。

05:02.760 --> 05:04.804
Whoo.
呼。

05:04.887 --> 05:07.140
Now let's see what this
rusty old pelican can do.
现在让我们看看这是什么
生锈的老鹈鹕可以做到。

05:07.223 --> 05:08.850
Let's sail!
我们扬帆起航吧！

05:08.933 --> 05:09.934
Aye sir.
是的，先生。

05:12.186 --> 05:14.022
Ahoy, Capt'n.
嘿，船长。

05:14.105 --> 05:15.606
We be catching a mighty gale
from the Northeast.
我们正遭遇一场大风
来自东北。

05:15.690 --> 05:18.026
Indeed, indeed, and...
确实，确实，而且……

05:18.109 --> 05:20.486
And just look at the
treacherous surf in our path.
只要看看
我们的道路上有危险的海浪。

05:28.202 --> 05:31.706
Oh, that salty sea air
be so thick
哦，咸咸的海洋空气
这么厚

05:31.789 --> 05:33.875
you can almost
taste it.
你几乎可以
尝尝它。

05:33.958 --> 05:36.711
I'd better take the helm and
guide us to safer waters.
我最好掌舵
引导我们前往更安全的水域。

05:38.629 --> 05:42.216
Aye, that'd be a wicked sounding
wind out there, eh, Granddad?
是的，这听起来很邪恶
外面有风吗，呃，爷爷？

05:43.593 --> 05:46.012
I said, "Aye...
我说：“是啊……

05:46.095 --> 05:48.056
That'd be a wicked
sounding wind out there."
那将是一个恶人
外面有风声。”

05:48.139 --> 05:49.307
Oh.
哦。

05:52.143 --> 05:53.853
There is it.
就是这样。

05:53.936 --> 05:55.855
That wind storm
I mentioned earlier...
那一场风暴
我之前提到过...

05:58.483 --> 06:00.651
And, oh, apparently
the cabin is haunted as well.
而且，哦，显然
小屋也闹鬼。

06:00.735 --> 06:04.197
What's a hair net doing
on a pirate ship?
发网有什么作用
在海盗船上？

06:06.282 --> 06:08.242
Any pirate knows that the
majority of his daily nutrition
任何海盗都知道
他的大部分日常营养

06:08.326 --> 06:10.286
comes from whatever
hair or skin flakes
来自任何事物
头发或皮肤碎片

06:10.369 --> 06:13.039
fall off of the cook
and into the stew.
从厨师身上掉下来
并放入炖菜中。

06:13.122 --> 06:14.707
This hair net
is depriving your crew
这个发网
剥夺了你的船员的权利

06:14.791 --> 06:16.584
of their essential nutrients.
他们的必需营养素。

06:16.667 --> 06:18.544
Eh... Just a sec.
呃……等一下。

06:20.755 --> 06:22.298
Look out, Grandpa,
we're under attack.
爷爷，你要小心，
我们受到攻击。

06:27.637 --> 06:29.931
Aye, look at the size
of that beast.
嗯，看尺寸
那只野兽的。

06:30.014 --> 06:31.140
Not to worry,
Granddad.
不用担心，
爷爷。

06:32.975 --> 06:35.520
Ah-ha, that's the stuff.
啊哈，就是这个东西。

06:35.603 --> 06:38.397
: Hee-yah!
: 嘿嘿！

06:38.481 --> 06:40.942
Eh, good toss,
hey, Granddad?
嗯，抛得好，
嘿，爷爷？

06:42.819 --> 06:44.112
Oh, nothing, look.
哦，没什么，看看。

06:47.907 --> 06:49.575
Ha-ha-ha-ha-
ha-ha-ha
哈哈哈哈哈哈——
哈哈哈

06:49.659 --> 06:51.619
that's me boy.
这就是我，男孩。

06:51.702 --> 06:52.745
All: Hooray!
全体：万岁！

06:52.829 --> 06:54.789
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

06:54.872 --> 06:57.166
Sounds like we got a prize.
听起来我们好像得到了奖品。

06:58.793 --> 07:00.211
Ready, Squidward?
准备好了吗，章鱼哥？

07:00.294 --> 07:02.004
You owe me big time, Mr. Krabs.
你欠我很大的情，蟹老板。

07:05.424 --> 07:07.844
Krabs: Aye, take that, ya...
螃蟹：是的，接受这个，你……

07:07.927 --> 07:10.096
Ya scurvy dog, ya.
是坏血病狗，是的。

07:10.179 --> 07:11.639
Whoo!
呼！

07:11.722 --> 07:13.891
Check the size of it, Granddad.
爷爷，检查一下它的大小。

07:13.975 --> 07:15.726
Granddad, check the...
爷爷，检查一下...

07:15.810 --> 07:17.478
Granddad?
爷爷？

07:17.562 --> 07:19.397
Trouble approaching quick.
麻烦很快就来了。

07:19.480 --> 07:21.941
Approximately 10 clicks
off the starboard bow.
大约 10 次点击
位于右舷船头。

07:22.024 --> 07:24.694
Man your
battle stations.
男人你的
战斗站。

07:24.777 --> 07:26.612
Oh, no, if Granddad
sees something
哦，不，如果爷爷
看到一些东西

07:26.696 --> 07:28.447
it must be the real deal.
这一定是货真价实的。

07:28.531 --> 07:31.242
What do you got,
cotton in your ears... Move!
你有什么，
耳朵里有棉花……动起来！

07:41.544 --> 07:43.546
What exactly are we dealing
with, Grandpa?
我们到底在处理什么
和，爷爷？

07:43.629 --> 07:45.173
Something more hideous
than I've ever seen.
更可怕的东西
比我见过的还要多。

07:45.256 --> 07:47.383
A raving gargantuan banshee
一只狂暴的巨型女妖

07:47.466 --> 07:49.927
with a coarse matted mane
of tangled locks.
有着粗糙的乱蓬蓬的鬃毛
缠结的锁。

07:50.011 --> 07:51.512
Ugh.
啊。

07:51.596 --> 07:52.930
Sounds repulsive.
听起来很令人反感。

07:53.014 --> 07:55.808
Yeah, it must be destroyed.
是啊，必须毁掉。

07:55.892 --> 07:58.269
Here, see for yourself.
在这里，你自己看看。

07:58.352 --> 07:59.812
Go get it, Granddad.
去拿吧，爷爷。

08:01.856 --> 08:04.025
Wait a minute...
等一下...

08:04.108 --> 08:06.611
What kind of disgusting
horrible aberration dare
invade me vessel?
什么样的恶心
可怕的畸变敢
入侵我的船？

08:06.694 --> 08:08.446
Dad!
爸爸！

08:08.529 --> 08:10.406
That disgusting
horrible thing...
那个恶心的
可怕的事情...

08:10.489 --> 08:11.991
is me daughter.
是我女儿。

08:13.910 --> 08:15.828
Open up!
打开！

08:15.912 --> 08:18.247
Prepare to meet
yer maker, sea witch.
准备见面
你的创造者，海女巫。

08:20.208 --> 08:21.417
Krabs: No!
蟹蟹：不！

08:21.500 --> 08:23.502
What are ya doing?
你在做什么？

08:23.586 --> 08:25.630
Oh, I... I was, uh...
哦，我...我是，呃...

08:25.713 --> 08:27.465
Just checkin' the cannon,
making sure it was loaded.
只是检查大炮，
确保它已加载。

08:30.593 --> 08:32.261
Papier-maché?
纸浆？

08:32.345 --> 08:33.679
What is this?
这是什么？

08:33.763 --> 08:36.224
I can explain...
我可以解释一下...

08:36.307 --> 08:37.975
Dad!
爸爸！

08:38.059 --> 08:40.311
Now it's even more angry.
现在更是愤怒了。

08:40.394 --> 08:42.563
Don't worry, I have
it under control.
别担心，我有
它受到控制。

08:42.647 --> 08:44.690
Daddy!
爸爸！

08:44.774 --> 08:46.651
Pearl, could ya
pipe down?
珍珠，可以吗
管道下降？

08:46.734 --> 08:48.694
Your Great Granddad
Redbeard is in there.
你的曾祖父
红胡子就在里面。

08:50.446 --> 08:52.240
What's with
the lame outfit?
有什么
蹩脚的衣服？

08:52.323 --> 08:53.950
What... Oh, never
mind that.
什么...哦，从来没有
请介意。

08:54.033 --> 08:55.117
Just go home.
回家吧。

08:58.663 --> 09:00.456
Aargh...
啊啊……

09:02.833 --> 09:05.044
I bet you're
wondering about that.
我打赌你是
想知道这一点。

09:05.127 --> 09:08.464
Well, you're darn
tootin' I am.
好吧，你真该死
我也是。

09:11.634 --> 09:12.468
Do you mind?
你介意吗？

09:16.305 --> 09:18.724
What kind of ship
are you running here?
什么样的船
你跑到这里了吗？

09:18.808 --> 09:19.892
Just a second.
稍等一下。

09:19.976 --> 09:22.770
Grr... Aargh.
呃……啊啊。

09:25.189 --> 09:27.024
Aargh!
啊啊！

09:27.108 --> 09:28.901
Now, Granddad,
there's a simple explanation.
现在，爷爷，
有一个简单的解释。

09:28.985 --> 09:31.237
I've smelled
a lot of stinky things
我闻过
很多臭东西

09:31.320 --> 09:33.072
but nothing smells stinkier
但没有什么比这更臭了

09:33.155 --> 09:35.032
than a lie.
比谎言。

09:35.116 --> 09:37.076
There's a code that
all pirates live by.
有一段代码
所有海盗都以此为生。

09:37.159 --> 09:39.495
You knows what
it is, don't ya?
你知道什么
是的，不是吗？

09:39.578 --> 09:41.664
Of course
I do, Granddad.
当然
我愿意，爷爷。

09:41.747 --> 09:44.000
Well then... Say it.
那么……说吧。

09:44.083 --> 09:46.043
OK, it's...
好吧，这是...

09:46.127 --> 09:47.920
It's, it's...
这是、这是...

09:48.004 --> 09:50.756
A pirate never lies.
海盗从不说谎。

09:52.466 --> 09:55.261
And I've been
a dirty liar.
我已经
一个肮脏的骗子。

09:58.347 --> 10:01.142
Everything you've seen is a lie.
你所看到的一切都是谎言。

10:01.225 --> 10:03.019
This sail is a lie.
这帆是一个谎言。

10:07.857 --> 10:09.442
This crew is a lie.
这个船员是个谎言。

10:09.525 --> 10:12.778
Grr...
呃……

10:15.239 --> 10:17.366
Even this ship is a lie.
甚至这艘船也是一个谎言。

10:32.423 --> 10:33.299
All of it.
所有这一切。

10:37.553 --> 10:39.889
All a lie.
都是谎言。

10:39.972 --> 10:42.683
Krabby Patties: $2.00.
蟹黄饼：2.00 美元。

10:42.767 --> 10:45.019
Krusty Combo: $3.99.
Krusty 组合：3.99 美元。

10:45.102 --> 10:47.646
Coral bits: $1.95?
珊瑚块：1.95 美元？

10:47.730 --> 10:49.523
So you see, Granddad...
所以你看，爷爷...

10:49.607 --> 10:50.983
I'm no pirate.
我不是海盗。

10:51.067 --> 10:54.236
Just a lowly restaurant owner.
只是一个卑微的餐馆老板。

10:54.320 --> 10:57.823
I'm sorry I failed ye.
很抱歉我让你们失望了。

10:57.907 --> 10:58.991
Failed me,
boy?
让我失败了，
男孩？

11:01.035 --> 11:03.996
Why, I couldn't
be more proud.
为什么，我不能
更加自豪。

11:04.080 --> 11:05.998
Look at yer
ludicrous prices.
看看你
可笑的价格。

11:06.082 --> 11:08.834
Now that's real piracy.
现在这才是真正的盗版。

11:08.918 --> 11:11.504
Ya done good, boy-o.
你做得很好，男孩。

11:11.587 --> 11:12.713
Really?
真的吗？

11:12.797 --> 11:14.423
Thanks, Granddad.
谢谢，爷爷。

11:14.507 --> 11:16.425
Well, you can thank
yourself, lad.
嗯，你可以感谢
你自己，小伙子。

11:16.509 --> 11:18.469
You created this
dynasty on yer own.
你创造了这个
王朝靠你自己。

11:18.552 --> 11:21.138
Ha-ha, now, I'll be
taking me leave, boy.
哈哈，现在我就
带我离开吧，孩子。

11:21.222 --> 11:24.016
Good-bye, Granddad.
再见，爷爷。

11:24.100 --> 11:26.685
What an honest man.
多么诚实的一个人啊。

11:29.313 --> 11:31.315
Grandpa: I hope
you don't mind, boy-o
爷爷：我希望
你不介意，男孩

11:31.399 --> 11:33.567
but I helped myself to
a little bit of your booty.
但我帮助自己
你的一点点战利品。

11:38.447 --> 11:40.699
I knew I got me talent
from someone.
我知道我有天赋
来自某人。

11:40.783 --> 11:43.202
: Ah,
gah-gah-gah-gah-gah-gah.
：啊，
嘎嘎嘎嘎。

11:53.963 --> 11:56.048
SpongeBob: ♪ Workin'
at the Krusty Krab ♪
海绵宝宝：♪ 工作中
在蟹堡蟹店♪

11:56.132 --> 11:57.883
♪ Workin' at the Krusty Krab,
la, la, la... ♪
♪ 在蟹堡王工作，
啦啦啦……♪

11:57.967 --> 11:59.552
Ooh.
哦。

11:59.635 --> 12:01.262
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

12:01.345 --> 12:02.805
Squidward.
章鱼哥。

12:05.015 --> 12:06.559
Squidward,
are you OK?
章鱼哥，
你还好吗？

12:06.642 --> 12:08.394
Oh, I couldn't be better.
哦，我不能更好了。

12:08.477 --> 12:10.980
Mister Krabs!
蟹蟹先生！

12:13.816 --> 12:15.568
It happened again,
Mr. Krabs.
事情又发生了，
蟹老板。

12:15.651 --> 12:16.944
What are you
talking about?
你在说什么？

12:17.027 --> 12:17.903
It's Squidward.
这是章鱼哥。

12:19.280 --> 12:20.739
What is it about the third
Wednesday of every month
第三个是什么
每个月的星期三

12:20.823 --> 12:22.616
that makes Squidward so happy?
这让章鱼哥如此高兴？

12:24.243 --> 12:27.580
Psst, Squidward...
嘘，章鱼哥……

12:27.663 --> 12:29.165
Roger, is that you?
罗杰，是你吗？

12:29.248 --> 12:30.374
Tonight's the big night.
今晚是个重要的夜晚。

12:37.006 --> 12:39.008
SpongeBob: These camouflage
outfits should help us find out
海绵宝宝：这些伪装
服装应该可以帮助我们找到答案

12:39.091 --> 12:41.010
what Squidward's secret
Wednesday secret is.
章鱼哥的秘密是什么
星期三的秘密是。

13:11.123 --> 13:11.999
Hello, brother Roger.
你好，罗杰兄弟。

13:20.716 --> 13:22.426
Come right in,
brother Squidward.
进来吧，
章鱼哥。

13:22.510 --> 13:23.594
Thank you.
谢谢。

13:30.476 --> 13:31.894
This almost makes the other
这几乎让其他

13:31.977 --> 13:35.105
353 days worth living for.
353天值得活下去。

13:42.571 --> 13:45.074
For centuries...
几个世纪以来...

13:45.157 --> 13:48.244
Cephalopods have had
but one nemesis.
头足类动物有
但有一个克星。

13:48.327 --> 13:50.538
Let he among you
让他在你们中间

13:50.621 --> 13:52.623
who wishes to join the lodge
谁想加入旅馆

13:52.706 --> 13:55.334
face your greatest fear.
面对你最大的恐惧。

13:55.417 --> 13:58.003
Cantankerous moray eelius
脾气暴躁的海鳗

14:01.423 --> 14:03.259
Huh?
啊？

14:07.221 --> 14:10.099
I'll never forget
my initiation ceremony.
我永远不会忘记
我的入会仪式。

14:17.940 --> 14:19.525
Yeah!
是的！

14:19.608 --> 14:20.818
Way to go.
一路走好。

14:26.031 --> 14:30.286
SpongeBob, Patrick,
did you follow me here?
海绵宝宝、帕特里克、
你跟着我到这里来了吗？

14:30.369 --> 14:32.871
Brother Squidward?
章鱼哥？

14:32.955 --> 14:35.749
For thousands of years
no outsiders
几千年来
没有外人

14:35.833 --> 14:39.086
have witnessed
this sacred initiation.
见证过
这个神圣的启蒙。

14:39.169 --> 14:41.672
You have desecrated
the sanctity
你亵渎了
神圣性

14:41.755 --> 14:43.591
of this lodge.
这家旅馆的。

14:43.674 --> 14:45.634
:
But, but, I, I, I...
：
但是，但是，我，我，我……

14:57.521 --> 14:59.523
Oh, I can't believe it.
哦，我简直不敢相信。

14:59.607 --> 15:02.526
They kicked me out of
the Cephalopod Lodge.
他们把我踢出了
头足类动物旅馆。

15:02.610 --> 15:03.652
Do we get to
join the lodge?
我们能到达吗
加入旅馆吗？

15:06.155 --> 15:08.866
Were you dropped on your head
when you were a baby?
你是否被摔在头上
当你还是个婴儿的时候？

15:10.409 --> 15:11.744
Psychic powers.
心灵力量。

15:11.827 --> 15:13.704
Hey, where's Patrick?
嘿，帕特里克在哪儿？

15:13.787 --> 15:15.331
Maybe he got
to join the lodge?
也许他得到了
加入小屋？

15:15.414 --> 15:17.625
Or maybe not.
或者也许不是。

15:17.708 --> 15:19.543
They didn't let you
join either?
他们没有让你
要么加入？

15:19.627 --> 15:21.587
Nah, I found
the institution
不，我发现了
该机构

15:21.670 --> 15:23.756
had nothing
left to offer me.
一无所有
留下来向我提供。

15:23.839 --> 15:25.466
I was stagnating.
我停滞不前。

15:25.549 --> 15:27.259
Hey, where's Squidward?
嘿，章鱼哥在哪里？

15:27.343 --> 15:28.761
Hold on, um...
坚持住，嗯...

15:31.639 --> 15:33.432
Found Squidward,
hmm...  .
发现章鱼哥，
嗯……

15:40.856 --> 15:43.859
The last thing in my life
I really enjoyed
我生命中最后一件事
我真的很喜欢

15:43.942 --> 15:47.613
and SpongeBob ruined it too.
海绵宝宝也毁了它。

15:49.406 --> 15:51.450
at least you still
have the hat.
至少你还在
有帽子。

15:51.533 --> 15:53.452
Yeah  ?
是的  ？

15:53.535 --> 15:54.953
I do, don't I?
我愿意，不是吗？

15:58.332 --> 16:00.042
You still have
your robes.
你还有
你的长袍。

16:00.125 --> 16:02.544
You still have
your underwear.
你还有
你的内衣。

16:02.628 --> 16:04.463
Squidward: No!
章鱼哥：不！

16:06.590 --> 16:07.466
You can look now.
你现在可以看看。

16:09.093 --> 16:11.303
Don't you worry,
Squidward.
你不用担心，
章鱼哥。

16:11.387 --> 16:12.971
I'm sure if Patrick
and I just explain
what happened
我确信如果帕特里克
我只是解释一下
发生了什么事

16:13.055 --> 16:14.390
they're sure to let you back in.
他们一定会让你回来的。

16:17.518 --> 16:19.311
What is it?
它是什么？

16:19.395 --> 16:21.271
Oh, it's you two.
噢，是你们两个。

16:21.355 --> 16:23.691
We just came to explain
that Squidward had no idea
我们只是来解释一下
章鱼哥不知道

16:23.774 --> 16:25.025
that we followed him
to the lodge.
我们跟着他
到旅馆。

16:25.109 --> 16:26.527
So it's not his fault.
所以这不是他的错。

16:26.610 --> 16:27.861
Yeah, not his fault.
是的，不是他的错。

16:27.945 --> 16:29.321
Then whose fault was it?
那么这又是谁的错呢？

16:29.405 --> 16:31.073
Is it my fault?
是我的错吗？

16:31.156 --> 16:32.616
No, it wasn't
your fault, Patrick.
不，不是的
你的错，帕特里克。

16:32.700 --> 16:34.326
Thanks, SpongeBob.
谢谢，海绵宝宝。

16:34.410 --> 16:36.078
And it wasn't
your fault either.
事实并非如此
也是你的错。

16:36.161 --> 16:38.247
Well, if it
wasn't your fault
好吧，如果是的话
不是你的错

16:38.330 --> 16:40.457
and it wasn't
Squidward's fault,
whose fault was it?
它不是
都是章鱼哥的错
这是谁的错？

16:40.541 --> 16:42.084
Uhh...
呃...

16:42.167 --> 16:44.086
Maybe it's
your fault.
也许是
你的错。

16:44.169 --> 16:46.380
Squidward is never allowed
in this lodge again.
章鱼哥是绝对不被允许的
再次来到这个小屋。

16:48.424 --> 16:50.426
SpongeBob, are they letting me
back in the lodge?
海绵宝宝，他们让我吗
回到小屋？

16:50.509 --> 16:52.761
No, you can't set
foot in the lodge.
不，你不能设置
脚走进小屋。

16:52.845 --> 16:54.012
Ever!
曾经！

16:54.096 --> 16:56.306
Ohh...
哦...

16:56.390 --> 16:58.600
Now that you two have ruined
the last good thing in my life
既然你们两个已经毁了
我生命中最后的好事

16:58.684 --> 17:01.019
I think I'll go home
我想我会回家

17:01.103 --> 17:04.982
and slam my head
in the door... Repeatedly.
并猛击我的头
在门里……反复。

17:05.065 --> 17:07.109
SpongeBob: Squidward, wait.
海绵宝宝：章鱼哥，等等。

17:07.192 --> 17:09.236
I'm sorry we got you kicked out
of your lodge.
很抱歉我们把你赶了出来
你的小屋。

17:09.319 --> 17:11.321
Is there anything I can do
to make it up to you?
有什么我可以做的吗
来弥补你吗？

17:11.405 --> 17:14.575
No- why didn't you just
make up your own dumb club
不-你为什么不直接
组建你自己的愚蠢俱乐部

17:14.658 --> 17:17.244
instead of
ruining mine?
而不是
毁了我的？

17:17.327 --> 17:19.038
That's it!
就是这样！

17:21.039 --> 17:23.417
Squidward, we'll make
our own club.
章鱼哥，我们会做
我们自己的俱乐部。

17:23.500 --> 17:26.253
And it'll be so much
better than that dumb old
"Ceplafalehflopop" Lodge.
而且会这么多
比那个愚蠢的老头好
“Ceplafalehflopop”旅馆。

17:26.336 --> 17:28.547
And  you  can be our leader.
你可以成为我们的领导者。

17:28.630 --> 17:33.051
How great does that sound,
oh, mighty one?
这听起来多么棒，
噢，强大的一个？

17:33.135 --> 17:34.928
Want to join
our club, Patrick?
想加入
我们的俱乐部，帕特里克？

17:35.012 --> 17:37.014
Dog pile on Squidward.
狗堆在章鱼哥身上。

17:37.097 --> 17:38.807
SpongeBob: Squidward,
you're the lodge expert.
海绵宝宝：章鱼哥，
你是旅馆专家。

17:38.891 --> 17:40.309
What do we do first?
我们首先做什么？

17:40.392 --> 17:41.977
Say good-bye.
告别。

17:42.060 --> 17:43.353
Good-bye.
再见。

17:43.437 --> 17:44.730
Morons.
白痴。

17:44.813 --> 17:47.024
So anyway, Squidward-
所以无论如何，章鱼哥——

17:47.107 --> 17:48.817
I was thinking
we should be working on our
secret lodge initiations.
我在想
我们应该致力于我们的
秘密小屋的入会仪式。

17:48.901 --> 17:50.736
Hey.
嘿。

17:50.819 --> 17:52.321
Patrick and I have come up
with a secret handshake.
帕特里克和我已经上来了
秘密握手。

17:52.404 --> 17:53.280
Secret!
秘密！

17:55.616 --> 17:58.619
Patty cake, patty cake,
sailor man.
馅饼，馅饼，
水手人。

17:58.702 --> 18:00.496
Bake me a cake
as fast...
给我烤个蛋糕
一样快...

18:00.579 --> 18:02.080
Squidward: SpongeBob!
章鱼哥：海绵宝宝！

18:02.164 --> 18:03.832
That's not
a secret handshake.
那不是
秘密握手。

18:03.916 --> 18:05.125
Everybody knows
patty cake.
大家都知道
肉饼蛋糕。

18:05.209 --> 18:07.044
Not the way we do it.
不是我们做事的方式。

18:07.127 --> 18:10.422
We don't use
our pinkies.
我们不使用
我们的小指。

18:10.506 --> 18:12.758
: Out!
： 出去！

18:12.841 --> 18:16.762
I don't think Squidward
wants to join our lodge.
我不认为章鱼哥
想加入我们的旅馆。

18:16.845 --> 18:18.222
Oh, sure he does.
哦，当然他知道。

18:18.305 --> 18:20.015
He just needs a little push.
他只需要一点推动。

18:21.892 --> 18:23.143
Oh, what now?
哦，现在怎么办？

18:23.227 --> 18:24.853
: I'm coming.
: 我来了。

18:24.937 --> 18:27.105
What do you... Great.
你做什么...太好了。

18:27.189 --> 18:29.066
Must be one of
SpongeBob's pranks.
必须是其中之一
海绵宝宝的恶作剧。

18:32.027 --> 18:33.237
Let's move.
我们走吧。

18:36.865 --> 18:38.075
OK, we can let
him out now.
好的，我们可以让
现在他出去了。

18:38.158 --> 18:39.952
Are you insane?
你疯了吗？

18:40.035 --> 18:41.703
You kidnapped me?
你绑架了我？

18:41.787 --> 18:43.789
Oh, we didn't kidnap you.
哦，我们没有绑架你。

18:43.872 --> 18:45.290
We just brought
you here for...
我们刚刚带来了
你来这里是为了...

18:45.374 --> 18:47.084
Initiation.
引发。

18:47.167 --> 18:48.794
What kind
of initiation?
什么样的
的启蒙？

18:48.877 --> 18:51.964
A very special initiation.
一个非常特别的启蒙。

18:52.047 --> 18:54.633
Oh, boy,
look at the time,
gotta run.
哦，男孩，
看看时间，
得跑了。

18:54.716 --> 18:55.551
Oh.
哦。

18:57.052 --> 18:59.179
Would you care to go
first, brother Patrick?
你愿意去吗
首先，帕特里克兄弟？

18:59.263 --> 19:01.598
After you,
brother SpongeBob.
在你之后，
海绵宝宝弟弟。

19:04.101 --> 19:06.520
La...
拉...

19:06.603 --> 19:08.772
Ah, oh, ooh!
啊，哦，哦！

19:08.856 --> 19:10.732
"Bruthuh Pathrith?"
“布鲁图·帕特里斯？”

19:10.816 --> 19:11.692
Brother SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝兄弟？

19:17.739 --> 19:19.241
"Bruthu Squidwuth"?
“布鲁图乌贼”？

19:30.669 --> 19:31.920
Oh.
哦。

19:35.757 --> 19:37.843
What's this, can it be?
这是什么，可以吗？

19:37.926 --> 19:39.177
My lodge robes.
我的小屋长袍。

19:39.261 --> 19:42.180
I'm back in the lodge.
我回到小屋了

19:42.264 --> 19:43.891
I gotta try 'em on.
我得试穿一下。

19:43.974 --> 19:46.143
Huh- this can't be right.
哈——这不对。

19:46.226 --> 19:48.186
These aren't
my Cephalopod robes.
这些不是
我的头足类长袍。

19:49.771 --> 19:51.523
They sure aren't.
他们肯定不是。

19:51.607 --> 19:53.817
They're your uniform
for your new lodge.
它们是你的制服
为你的新小屋。

19:53.901 --> 19:56.695
Welcome to the first
official meeting of...
欢迎来到第一
正式会议...

19:56.778 --> 19:58.488
The Feather Friends.
羽毛之友。

19:58.572 --> 20:00.240
Feather Friends?
羽友？

20:00.324 --> 20:02.159
Somebody already had
Feather Buddies.
已经有人有过
羽毛伙伴们。

20:02.242 --> 20:04.536
Yeah, those Feather
Buddies better hope
是的，那些羽毛
小伙伴们更希望

20:04.620 --> 20:06.914
they don't run into us
in a dark alley.
他们不会碰到我们
在一个黑暗的小巷里。

20:08.540 --> 20:10.250
Ahh!
啊！

20:10.334 --> 20:13.921
I don't want to be
a Feather Buddy!
我不想成为
一个羽毛伙伴！

20:14.004 --> 20:15.756
Do you still wanna
be a Feather Friend?
你还想吗
成为羽毛的朋友吗？

20:15.839 --> 20:17.925
Grrr...
咕噜……

20:18.008 --> 20:20.218
No.
不。

20:20.302 --> 20:22.971
Squidward, I hadn't
realized how special
your lodge was to you.
章鱼哥，我没有
意识到有多特别
你的小屋是给你的。

20:23.055 --> 20:24.640
I'll get you back in that club.
我会让你回到那个俱乐部。

20:24.723 --> 20:26.642
And I know just
how to do it.
我知道只是
怎么做。

20:26.725 --> 20:28.310
Everything we need
is in this drawer.
我们需要的一切
就在这个抽屉里。

20:30.979 --> 20:32.356
Squidward: A sock?
章鱼哥：袜子？

20:32.439 --> 20:34.983
Not just a sock, a disguise.
不仅仅是一只袜子，更是一种伪装。

20:35.067 --> 20:36.735
Patrick and I will climb
inside the sock
帕特里克和我会攀登
袜子里面

20:36.818 --> 20:40.238
and pretend to be
a giant Albino eel.
并假装是
一条巨大的白化鳗鱼

20:40.322 --> 20:42.115
We will then gain
entrance to the lodge
那么我们将获得
小屋的入口

20:42.199 --> 20:44.076
and frighten everyone inside.
并吓坏里面的每个人。

20:44.159 --> 20:46.244
Once they're good and terrified
一旦他们表现良好并感到害怕

20:46.328 --> 20:48.705
you, Squidward, will storm in,
defeat that giant eel
你，章鱼哥，会冲进来，
打败那条巨型鳗鱼

20:48.789 --> 20:51.333
and rescue all
of the lodge members.
并营救所有人
分会成员。

20:51.416 --> 20:53.377
You'll be a hero, Squidward.
你会成为英雄的，章鱼哥。

20:53.460 --> 20:54.795
They'll have to let you
back in the lodge.
他们必须让你
回到小屋。

20:54.878 --> 20:56.922
Hm, it's genius.
嗯，真是天才。

20:57.005 --> 20:59.716
But I see one flaw
in your plan.
但我看到一个缺陷
在你的计划中。

20:59.800 --> 21:01.718
One  flaw?
一个缺陷？

21:01.802 --> 21:04.096
That sock is
way too small.
那只袜子是
太小了。

21:04.179 --> 21:06.223
Yeah, it is.
是的，确实如此。

21:06.306 --> 21:07.975
Time to break out
the heavy artillery.
是时候爆发了
重炮。

21:08.058 --> 21:10.060
That's what
I'm talking about.
就是这样
我说的是。

21:13.397 --> 21:16.692
SpongeBob: OK, Squidward,
just give us five minutes
and then do your stuff.
海绵宝宝：好的，章鱼哥，
给我们五分钟
然后做你的事情。

21:18.485 --> 21:20.028
French Man: Five minutes later.
法国人：五分钟后。

21:22.656 --> 21:23.991
This is ridiculous.
这太荒谬了。

21:24.074 --> 21:26.118
No one is dumb enough to believe
没有人傻到相信

21:26.201 --> 21:28.829
SpongeBob and Patrick are a...
海绵宝宝和帕特里克是...

21:28.912 --> 21:31.373
A giant Albino eel?
巨型白化鳗鱼？

21:31.456 --> 21:32.708
Eel: Roar!
鳗鱼：咆哮！

21:35.502 --> 21:36.837
Roar!
吼！

21:36.920 --> 21:38.296
Unbelievable.
难以置信。

21:38.380 --> 21:40.340
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

21:40.424 --> 21:41.842
There's a giant Albino
eel on the loose.
有一个巨大的白化病
鳗鱼散了。

21:41.925 --> 21:43.218
Ahem, do not worry.
咳咳，别担心。

21:43.301 --> 21:44.720
I will save you.
我会救你的。

21:44.803 --> 21:46.471
Begone, foul beast
走开，邪恶的野兽

21:46.555 --> 21:48.098
or I will smite thee.
不然我就打你。

21:49.933 --> 21:50.976
SpongeBob: Aargh.
海绵宝宝：啊啊。

21:51.059 --> 21:52.894
...Oof!
...钱币！

21:52.978 --> 21:55.313
All: Yay!
全体：耶！

21:55.397 --> 21:58.191
: Squidward,
Squidward, Squidward...
： 章鱼哥，
章鱼哥，章鱼哥……

21:58.275 --> 21:59.943
...Squidward, Squidward
……章鱼哥，章鱼哥

22:00.027 --> 22:01.611
Squidward, Squidward.
章鱼哥，章鱼哥。

22:04.072 --> 22:05.157
SpongeBob/Squidward:
Yes, yes!
海绵宝宝/章鱼哥：
是的，是的！

22:07.159 --> 22:08.785
Way to go Squidward.
去鱿鱼哥吧。

22:08.869 --> 22:09.745
It worked.
它起作用了。

22:10.996 --> 22:12.831
Heh-heh...
呵呵...

22:12.914 --> 22:15.542
Whoa-whoa... Whoa.
哇-哇...哇。

22:20.547 --> 22:22.591
Don't worry, Squidward.
别担心，章鱼哥。

22:22.674 --> 22:24.760
We still have
the Feather Friends.
我们还有
羽毛之友。

22:24.843 --> 22:28.680
But you'll have to pass
the initiation again.
但你必须通过
再次启动。

22:28.764 --> 22:29.765
Ah, ahh!
啊啊啊！

啊啊啊！